==========

Text [1] Linear strands of multigraded free resolutions (see
https://arxiv.org/pdf/2202.00402v4 ) (with Daniel Erman), Mathematische Annalen
390 (2024), 2707–2725 [2] Tate resolutions on toric varieties (see
https://arxiv.org/pdf/2108.03345v3 ) (with Daniel Erman), Journal of the
European Mathematical Society, published online (2024)



