foldComplex -- converts a chain complex into a differential module
******************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        foldComplex(C)
  * Inputs:
      * C, a *note complex: (Complexes)Complex,, 
      * d, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note differential module: DifferentialModule,, 

Description
===========

Given a chain complex C and integer d it creates the corresponding (flag)
differential module of degree d.

+----------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x,y];                 |
+----------------------------------+
|i2 : C = freeResolution ideal(x,y)|
|                                  |
